    {
      "name": "Tech Modifications",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "inqActor14Trait0",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>If a Jokaero is given a piece of technology or weaponry and left unattended - or attended - for long enough, it will begin to modify it. Roll 1d10 to see example weapon modifications below.  1. Aesthetic Alteration 2. Gain Mono-Edge modification (CRB pg. 138) 3. Gain Fire Selector modification (CRB pg. 137) 4. Gain a Laser Sight modification (CRB pg. 138) 5. Gain the Reliable trait. (CRB pg. 125) 6. Gain the Twin-Linked Trait (Weapons of the Imperium pg. 3) 7. Gain the Lightweight quality. (CRB pg. 121) 8. Gain the Accurate trait (Weapons of the Imperium pg. 1) 9. Gain the Custom Grip modification (Weapon Modifications pg. 1) 10. Gain the Durable quality (CRB pg. 122)  Tech Mimicry: Whenever the Jokaero is mimicking the technology of other species, or modifying something to serve it, it gains Advantage on all Tech tests.</p>"
        },
